# SingleStore Kit

A distributed SingleStore cluster on the db nodes, managed by the SingleStore Operator, which
runs on the control node.

## Cluster Layout

| Component         | Node type | Count                        | Role                                   |
|-------------------|-----------|------------------------------|----------------------------------------|
| Operator          | control   | 1                            | Manages the MemsqlCluster              |
| Master aggregator | db        | 1                            | Takes client queries, holds metadata   |
| Child aggregators | db        | __SINGLESTORE_AGGREGATORS__  | Take client queries                    |
| Leaves            | db        | __SINGLESTORE_LEAVES__       | Hold the data, one per db node         |

The master aggregator shares a db node with a leaf. `start` sizes each leaf from the db node's
allocatable CPU and memory unless `--leaf-cores` and `--leaf-memory` were given, and prints the
sizes it chose.

## Connection

MySQL wire protocol on NodePort 30306 of any db node, which reaches every aggregator:

```
mysql -h <db-node-ip> -P 30306 -u root -p __SINGLESTORE_DATABASE__
```

Or through easy-db-lab, which knows the password from install:

```
easy-db-lab singlestore sql "SELECT 1"
```

Benchmark it with sysbench:

```
easy-db-lab kit install sysbench --target singlestore
easy-db-lab sysbench-singlestore prepare
easy-db-lab sysbench-singlestore start
```

## Lifecycle

- `singlestore start` builds a fresh cluster and creates the `__SINGLESTORE_DATABASE__` database.
- `singlestore stop` deletes the cluster and its data (PVCs). The next `start` is empty.
- `singlestore uninstall` stops a running cluster first, then removes the operator and its CRD.

A start the license refuses fails with SingleStore's error. Re-run
`easy-db-lab kit install singlestore --force` with the same args and smaller `--leaf-cores` and
`--leaf-memory`, then `singlestore start` again.

## Version

SingleStore node image: singlestore/node:__SINGLESTORE_VERSION__
